    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a11">

                <pb facs="0567" n="517" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg517"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 11.—From the legation of Portugal at
                        Rio Janeiro.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-17"><hi rendition="#small-caps">March</hi> 17,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Arranged in a friendly manner with Brazilian Government that corvettes should
                    depart to-morrow at 4:30, if before that no other order came from your
                    excellency.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paraty.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
